  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Body Control sphere (Staunch Wounds).</p>\n<p>While meditating with Staunch Wounds, you are not staggered while disabled or having nonlethal damage equal to your current hit points. You can also endure a failed saving throw from any death or negative energy effect.</p>\n<p>As a (clarity) talent, you can abandon your meditate approach in response to being reduced below 0 hit points, knocked unconscious from nonlethal damage, or killed by hit point damage, to gain the benefits of the Diehard feat as well as enough temporary hit points to remain at 0 hit points and conscious, to a maximum amount of temporary hit points equal to twice your associated ranks. These benefits last for 1 minute per associated rank.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/body-control#toc30\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
